# 【算法思路】对预测序列求解 MSE/RMSE/MAE 误差指标、检测训练与验证损失过拟合间隙并自动生成迭代简报。
import math
# 计算连续预测值的均方根及平均绝对误差
def compute_metrics(y_true,y_pred):
    n=len(y_true);errors=[t-p for t,p in zip(y_true,y_pred)]
    mse=sum(e*e for e in errors)/n
    return {"mse":round(mse,4),"rmse":round(math.sqrt(mse),4),"mae":round(sum(abs(e)for e in errors)/n,4)}
# 判断 val_loss-train_loss 间隙是否逾越警戒线并给出正则建议
def detect_overfitting(train_loss,val_loss,th=0.15):
    gap=val_loss-train_loss
    return {"overfitting":gap>th,"gap":round(gap,4),"recommendation":"add regularization or early stop"if gap>th else "ok"}
# 汇总最新轮次各项指标给出调参或稳步提升诊断趋势
def build_report(history):
    latest={k:v[-1] for k,v in history.items()}
    return {"latest_metrics":latest,"total_epochs":len(history.get("train_loss",[])),"trend":"improving"if history.get("val_acc",[0])[-1]>0.8 else "needs_tuning"}
